# Real financial data — never commit.
# The whole folder, not a filename pattern: these are bank exports dropped in by
# hand with whatever name the bank chose ("Chequing.CSV"), and the RBC export
# carries the full card number in every row. A pattern only covers the export
# whose name someone thought to add.
Transactions/
download-transactions*.csv
# Device debug screenshots (may show account details)
error screenshots/
*-screenshot*.png
# Local SQLite DBs hold real financial data — never track
local.db
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
